    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>What is Wand Mart?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wand Mart: A Totally Normal Magical Store\u2122</strong> is a co-op shop simulator with a twist of horror, roguelike elements, and a heavy dose of questionable magic.  <br>Sell artifacts, run your own magical business, dive into cursed dungeons, and try not to die on your shift.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s capitalism. With spells. \ud83d\udcbc\ud83d\udd2e</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/7e78193ad16cef082a5d1bf29f846dc0.poster.avif?t=1751786043\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/7e78193ad16cef082a5d1bf29f846dc0.webm?t=1751786043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/7e78193ad16cef082a5d1bf29f846dc0.mp4?t=1751786043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Welcome to Wand Mart, new employee!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congrats, you're hired! You're now part of the most magically unstable retail chain in the multiverse.  <br>Here\u2019s what your job includes (survival not guaranteed):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> and <strong>decorate</strong> your shop with cursed furniture and suspicious lighting \ud83e\uddf1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform <strong>magical rituals</strong> and craft artifacts (no license required) \ud83d\udcdc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn spells</strong> for every situation\u2014from floating candles to putting out actual fires \ud83d\udd25</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a procedurally generated <strong>dungeon</strong> right under the store, filled with loot and regret\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends</strong>, because terror is better shared \ud83d\udc7b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow your business</strong>: expand, hire undead assistants, and handle angry magical customers\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/b3b343019513ed8bdc44b986b4163ebe.poster.avif?t=1751786043\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/b3b343019513ed8bdc44b986b4163ebe.webm?t=1751786043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/b3b343019513ed8bdc44b986b4163ebe.mp4?t=1751786043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Team up and embrace magical capitalism</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running low on inventory? No problem\u2014grab a wand and head down into the abyss. \ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot of questionable origin\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected dungeon dwellers with zero chill \ud83d\udc3e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle rooms, magical traps, and cursed mini-challenges \ud83e\udde9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, that one friend who keeps casting fireball in tight corridors \ud83d\udd25</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the monsters aren\u2019t the real threat. Sometimes it\u2019s Gary with a wand.\u00a0\ud83d\ude2c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/4c8fa9bd123d218bbe0ef8b5aec70646.poster.avif?t=1751786043\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/4c8fa9bd123d218bbe0ef8b5aec70646.webm?t=1751786043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/4c8fa9bd123d218bbe0ef8b5aec70646.mp4?t=1751786043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Who is Wand Mart\u2122 for?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laughed your way through <strong>Lethal Company</strong> \ud83e\udd2a</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tried to play <strong>Phasmophobia</strong> but your friends ruined the vibe \ud83d\ude31</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy building, casting, screaming, and pretending it\u2019s fine \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love horror best when it\u2019s mixed with comedy \ud83d\ude02\ud83d\udc80</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always wanted to run a shop over ancient evil ruins \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then yes, this is very much your game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/151fed8832381d86a0277412cda5b121.poster.avif?t=1751786043\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/151fed8832381d86a0277412cda5b121.webm?t=1751786043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/151fed8832381d86a0277412cda5b121.mp4?t=1751786043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wand Mart\u2122 is not liable for lost employees, demon-related injuries, psychological trauma, or spontaneous toadification. \ud83d\udc38</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>By reading this page, you have legally entered into a magical binding contract. Probably.\u00a0</i></strong></p>",
